    <briefdescription>
<para>Return statements from <ref refid="structvy__run" kindref="compound">vy_run</ref> based on initial search key, iteration order and view lsn. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All statements with lsn &gt; vlsn are skipped. The API allows to traverse over resulting statements within two dimensions - key and lsn. next_key() switches to the youngest statement of the next key, according to the iteration order, and next_lsn() switches to an older statement for the same key. </para>    </detaileddescription>
